        <div class="card">
          <img src="/images/Dinweys-Potato-flakes-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Fiocchi Di Patate" />
          <h3 style="text-align:center">Fiocchi Di Patate</h3>
          <p><span class="tr_" data-orig="From standard to high-grade varieties" data-source="" id="tr_42">From standard to high-grade varieties</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="our potato flakes are designed to meet diverse industry needs" data-source="" id="tr_43">our potato flakes are designed to meet diverse industry needs</span>.</p>
          <p><span class="tr_" data-orig="Backed by" data-source="" id="tr_44">Backed by</span> <strong><span class="tr_" data-orig="FSSC certification" data-source="" id="tr_45">FSSC certification</span></strong>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="we have a strong global export track record" data-source="" id="tr_46">we have a strong global export track record</span>.</p>
          <p><span class="tr_" data-orig="We specialize in" data-source="" id="tr_47">We specialize in</span> <strong><span class="tr_" data-orig="OEM solutions" data-source="" id="tr_48">OEM solutions</span></strong>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="allowing us to customize specifications to your exact requirements" data-source="" id="tr_49">allowing us to customize specifications to your exact requirements</span>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <img src="/images/Dinweys-french-fries.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Patatine fritte congelate" />
          <h3 style="text-align:center">Patatine fritte congelate</h3>
          <p><span class="tr_" data-orig="Our ISO-certified facility produces high-quality frozen French fries available in" data-source="" id="tr_50">Our ISO-certified facility produces high-quality frozen French fries available in</span> <strong><span class="tr_" data-orig="various cuts and sizes" data-source="" id="tr_51">various cuts and sizes</span></strong>.</p>
          <p><span class="tr_" data-orig="We pride ourselves on flexibility" data-source="" id="tr_52">We pride ourselves on flexibility</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="offering" data-source="" id="tr_53">offering</span> <strong><span class="tr_" data-orig="bespoke OEM services" data-source="" id="tr_54">bespoke OEM services</span></strong> <span class="tr_" data-orig="to align perfectly with your brand and customer preferences" data-source="" id="tr_55">to align perfectly with your brand and customer preferences</span>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <img src="/images/potato-starch-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Fecola di patate" />
